      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_c_04_question_01",
      "hash64": "7C3A6F1AA1C9A783",
      "text": "1. What is the name of the geological formation\\n    in the center of the Paldea region?\\n\\nA) The Great Crater of Paldea\\nB) The Center of Paldea\\nC) The Paldean Valley Floor",
